Package: elite-hotas-fix
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: luna <https://github.com/LunaBaloona>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LunaBaloona/Virpil_devices_on_Linux
Description: Keep Virpil and other flight sticks and throttles working in Proton games
 Removes the stale "&IG_00" gamepad entries that Proton leaves in a game's
 Wine registry, which make Elite Dangerous see a flight stick or throttle
 as an "XB360 Pad". Also checks raw HID access, can install a udev rule,
 and prints the PROTON_ENABLE_HIDRAW launch options for your devices.
